            "prompt": "Ask a partner about the familiar trip. After their reply, request one clarification and suggest a practical next step.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "You are arranging a meeting. The partner says they have visited Beijing before, but you miss whether they want to meet today or tomorrow. Ask about their experience, request repetition of the missed meeting time, then propose meeting after that time is clarified. Do not invent their answer.\nFamiliar meanings available: to meet; to see each other; before; formerly; please say it once more.",
